      "section_offset": 270,
      "end_cell_offset": 3159,
      "kind": "display",
      "original": "$$\nH = \\begin{pmatrix}\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\[2mm]\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$",
      "sha256": "dfc3504a67646df9f5bb181e7464b1d1079d1cefae03cd5339f076d18b4f768b",
      "disposition": "not executed"
    },
    {
      "id": "M02",
      "cell_index": 0,
      "cell_id": "17463a96",
      "cell_offset": 3250,
      "section_offset": 490,
      "end_cell_offset": 3479,
      "kind": "display",
      "original": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nH \\vert 0\\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle\\\\[3mm]\nH \\vert 1\\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "sha256": "69eea81b04a4e8fa59eb17e68531ba7bb0debe8e56132878e2320c657db0c401",
      "disposition": "not executed"
    },
    {
      "id": "M03",
      "cell_index": 0,
      "cell_id": "17463a96",
      "cell_offset": 3541,
      "section_offset": 781,
      "end_cell_offset": 3711,
      "kind": "display",
      "original": "$$\nH \\vert a \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (-1)^a \\vert 1 \\rangle\n= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\sum_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}} (-1)^{ab} \\vert b\\rangle,\n$$",
      "sha256": "fbfd383575daf1b1fd580ab814774251cc283c1c0b3b646d78f0cfda720e78af",
      "disposition": "not executed"
    },
